                },
                {
                  "id": "p-lenders-look-for-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Your credit history gives lenders a sense of reliability. Strong credit can lead to better terms, but there are still options available for a range of credit situations.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-lenders-look-for-4",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Time in Business",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-lenders-look-for-5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Established businesses often have an easier time securing financing, but newer operations can still qualify depending on other factors.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-lenders-look-for-6",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Revenue and Cash Flow",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-lenders-look-for-7",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Lenders want to know your business can handle monthly payments comfortably.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-lenders-look-for-8",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "This is where working with a trusted dealer matters. Sun State Trailers helps guide you through the process so you're not left guessing what comes next.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-how-simple",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "How Sun State Trailers Makes Financing Simple",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "how-simple"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-how-simple-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Financing shouldn't feel like a roadblock. It should feel like a tool. At Sun State Trailers, the process is designed to be:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-how-simple-2",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Straightforward",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-how-simple-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "No unnecessary complexity. Just clear options and honest answers so you can make the right call.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-how-simple-4",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Supportive",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-how-simple-5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "You're not navigating this alone. The team works with you to find a solution that fits your business.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-how-simple-6",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Built Around Your Needs",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
