                  "id": "p-get-started-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If you're ready to invest in a dry van trailer, financing can help you do it without slowing your business down. <a href=\"/locations/trailer-sales\">Sun State Trailers</a> is here to help you find the right equipment and the right financing structure, so you can grow your business without feeling held back. Contact us today to explore dry van trailer financing and available trailers.",
